cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use tcmnetpharma in your research, please cite this software and the
  runtime dataset it consumes (see references below).
title: >-
  tcmnetpharma: multi-source Traditional Chinese Medicine network pharmacology
  analysis toolkit
abstract: >-
  An R package for Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) network pharmacology
  analysis. It integrates six upstream sources (TCMSP, HERB 2.0, BATMAN-TCM 2.0,
  ETCM2, ChEMBL 37, and SymMap/OpenTargets) calibrated against the 2025 edition
  of the Chinese Pharmacopoeia, and provides network, enrichment and module
  visualisation modules.
